#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Kadupul handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Kadupul.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against an LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHP's LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Kadupul resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Uthibitishaji wa Ndani</i> - Kadupul hushughulikia uthibitishaji wa watumiaji, ambao hukuruhusu kuunda watumiaji na kuwapa haki za maeneo tofauti ndani ya Kadupul.<br><br><i>Uthibitishaji Msingi wa Wavuti</i> - Uthibitishaji hushughulikiwa na seva ya wavuti. Watumiaji wanaweza kuongezwa au kuundwa kiotomatiki wanapoingia kwa mara ya kwanza ikiwa Mtumiaji wa Kiolezo amefafanuliwa, vinginevyo ruhusa za mgeni zilizofafanuliwa zitatumika.<br><br><i>Uthibitishaji wa LDAP</i> - Huruhusu uthibitishaji dhidi ya seva ya LDAP. Watumiaji wataundwa kiotomatiki wanapoingia kwa mara ya kwanza ikiwa Mtumiaji wa Kiolezo amefafanuliwa, vinginevyo ruhusa za mgeni zilizofafanuliwa zitatumika. Ikiwa moduli ya LDAP ya PHP haijawashwa, Uthibitishaji wa LDAP hautaonekana kama chaguo linaloweza kuchaguliwa.<br><br><i>Uthibitishaji wa Vikoa Vingi vya LDAP/AD</i> - Huruhusu wasimamizi kusaidia vikundi vingi tofauti kutoka saraka tofauti za LDAP/AD kufikia rasilimali za Kadupul. Kama ilivyo kwa Uthibitishaji wa LDAP, moduli ya LDAP ya PHP inahitajika kutumia mbinu hii.</blockquote>"

