#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Historically, Kadupul administrators created simple Data Input Methods that include commands like \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" to represent a numeric value for use in Kadupul Graphs.  In earlier versions of Kadupul, this was permitted.  However, this is an unsafe practice as it is a gateway for third party users to publish insecure Data Templates.  In modern Kadupul, these types of practices should be avoided.  However, we provide this option if you have older Data Input Methods that contain these unsafe Meta Characters and have not converted them to local scripts in the 'scripts' directory.  When this option is unchecked, Kadupul restricts shell-style metacharacters such as quotation marks, curly brackets, vertical bars, backslashes, and backticks.  Kadupul continues to allow greater-than and less-than signs for things like <path_cacti> and for input parameters, but if this option is unchecked, that is the limit of their permitted use."
msgstr "Kihistoria, wasimamizi wa Kadupul waliunda Mbinu rahisi za Kuingiza Data ambazo zinajumuisha amri kama \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" ili kuwakilisha thamani ya nambari kwa matumizi katika Grafu za Kadupul. Katika matoleo ya awali ya Kadupul, hii iliruhusiwa. Hata hivyo, hili ni jambo lisilo salama kwani ni mlango kwa watumiaji wengine kuchapisha Violezo vya Data visivyo salama. Katika Kadupul ya kisasa, mbinu za aina hii zinapaswa kuepukwa. Hata hivyo, tunatoa chaguo hili ikiwa una Mbinu za zamani za Kuingiza Data ambazo zina Vibambo hivi vya Meta Visivyo Salama na hujazigeuza kuwa hati za ndani katika saraka ya 'scripts'. Wakati chaguo hili halijatiwa tiki, Kadupul huzuia vibambo vya meta vya mtindo wa shell kama vile alama za nukuu, mabano yaliyopinda, mistari wima, mikwaju ya nyuma, na alama za nyuma. Kadupul inaendelea kuruhusu alama za kubwa-kuliko na ndogo-kuliko kwa vitu kama <path_cacti> na kwa vigezo vya ingizo, lakini ikiwa chaguo hili halijatiwa tiki, huo ndio kikomo cha matumizi yake yanayoruhusiwa."

