#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hours that samples refused by RRDtool, for example after a data source schema change, stay queued for retry before they are moved to the poller_output_rejected table.  Repair the RRDfile, then run cli/replay_rejected_samples.php to process them."
msgstr "Saa ambazo sampuli zilizokataliwa na RRDtool, kwa mfano baada ya mabadiliko ya schema ya chanzo cha data, hubaki kwenye foleni kwa jaribio tena kabla ya kuhamishiwa kwenye jedwali la poller_output_rejected. Rekebisha RRDfile, kisha endesha cli/replay_rejected_samples.php ili kuzichakata."

