#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool proxy server."
msgstr "Jina la mwenyeji wa DNS au anwani ya IP ya seva ya proksi ya RRDtool."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Default Threads allowed per process.  NOTE: Starting in Kadupul 1.2+, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector, and this is simply the Preset.  Using a higher number when using Spine will improve performance.  However, ensure that you have enough MySQL/MariaDB connections to support the following equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  You must also ensure that you have enough spare connections for user login connections as well."
msgstr "Nyuzi Chaguo-msingi zinazoruhusiwa kwa kila mchakato.  KUMBUKA: Kuanzia Kadupul 1.2+, mpangilio huu unasimamiwa katika Kikusanyaji Data, na huu ni Mpangilio wa Awali tu.  Kutumia namba ya juu zaidi unapotumia Spine kutaboresha utendaji.  Hata hivyo, hakikisha una miunganisho ya kutosha ya MySQL/MariaDB ili kusaidia mlinganyo ufuatao: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  Lazima pia uhakikishe una miunganisho ya ziada kwa miunganisho ya kuingia ya watumiaji pia."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Kadupul will use the Primary Kadupul Admin's Email account."
msgstr "Anwani ya Barua pepe ya kutuma Barua pepe za Arifa za Otomatiki ikiwa haijabainishwa katika kiwango cha Mtandao wa Otomatiki.  Ikiwa sehemu hii, au thamani ya Mtandao wa Otomatiki imeachwa wazi, Kadupul itatumia akaunti ya Barua pepe ya Msimamizi Mkuu wa Kadupul."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to use for Automation Notification Emails if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Kadupul will use the system default From Email Address."
msgstr "Anwani ya Barua pepe ya kutumia kwa Barua pepe za Arifa za Otomatiki ikiwa haijabainishwa katika kiwango cha Mtandao wa Otomatiki.  Ikiwa sehemu hii, au thamani ya Mtandao wa Otomatiki imeachwa wazi, Kadupul itatumia Anwani chaguo-msingi ya Barua pepe ya Mtumaji ya mfumo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Name to use for Automation Notification Emails if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Kadupul will use the system default From Name."
msgstr "Jina la Barua pepe ya kutumia kwa Barua pepe za Arifa za Otomatiki ikiwa halijabainishwa katika kiwango cha Mtandao wa Otomatiki.  Ikiwa sehemu hii, au thamani ya Mtandao wa Otomatiki imeachwa wazi, Kadupul itatumia Jina chaguo-msingi la Mtumaji la mfumo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Maximum width of the Tree to expand to, after which time, Tree branches will scroll on the page."
msgstr "Upana wa Juu zaidi wa Mti wa kupanua, ambapo baada ya hapo, matawi ya Mti yatakunjuka kwenye ukurasa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Minimum width of the Tree to contract to."
msgstr "Upana wa Chini kabisa wa Mti wa kupunguza."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Network Connect Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Muda wa Kusubiri wa Kuunganisha Mtandao kwa sekunde."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Pango font description to use for Graph Axis items, such as DejaVu Sans"
msgstr "Maelezo ya fonti ya Pango ya kutumia kwa vipengee vya Mhimili wa Grafu, kama vile DejaVu Sans"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Pango font description to use for Graph Legend items, such as DejaVu Sans Mono"
msgstr "Maelezo ya fonti ya Pango ya kutumia kwa vipengee vya Maelezo ya Grafu, kama vile DejaVu Sans Mono"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Pango font description to use for Graph Titles, such as DejaVu Sans Bold"
msgstr "Maelezo ya fonti ya Pango ya kutumia kwa Vichwa vya Grafu, kama vile DejaVu Sans Bold"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Pango font description to use for Graph Unit items, such as DejaVu Sans"
msgstr "Maelezo ya fonti ya Pango ya kutumia kwa vipengee vya Vipimo vya Grafu, kama vile DejaVu Sans"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The System default date format to use in Kadupul."
msgstr "Umbizo chaguo-msingi la tarehe la Mfumo la kutumia katika Kadupul."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The System default date separator to be used in Kadupul."
msgstr "Kitenganishi chaguo-msingi cha tarehe cha Mfumo cha kutumia katika Kadupul."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Kadupul web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Kadupul Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Kiasi cha muda, kwa sekunde, ambacho seva kuu ya wavuti ya Kadupul itasubiri jibu kutoka kwa Kikusanyaji Data cha Mbali ili kupata taarifa mbalimbali za Kifaa kabla ya kuacha ombi hilo.  Kwenye Vifaa vinavyohusiana na Vikusanyaji Data vingine isipokuwa Kikusanyaji Data Kikuu cha Kadupul, Wakala wa Mbali ni lazima atumike kukusanya taarifa za Kifaa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The color to be shown for business hours"
msgstr "Rangi itakayoonyeshwa kwa saa za kazi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The date format to use in Kadupul."
msgstr "Umbizo la tarehe la kutumia katika Kadupul."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The date separator to be used in Kadupul."
msgstr "Kitenganishi cha tarehe cha kutumia katika Kadupul."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Device Template used on all new Devices."
msgstr "Kiolezo chaguo-msingi cha Kifaa kinachotumika kwenye Vifaa vyote vipya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Graph Height to be used for all new Graph Templates."
msgstr "Kimo chaguo-msingi cha Grafu kitakachotumika kwa Violezo vyote vipya vya Grafu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Graph Width to be used for all new Graph Templates."
msgstr "Upana chaguo-msingi wa Grafu utakaotumika kwa Violezo vyote vipya vya Grafu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Image Format to be used for all new Graph Templates."
msgstr "Umbizo chaguo-msingi la Picha litakalotumika kwa Violezo vyote vipya vya Grafu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Poller for all new Devices."
msgstr "Poller chaguo-msingi kwa Vifaa vyote vipya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default RRA to use in rare occasions."
msgstr "RRA chaguo-msingi ya kutumia katika matukio machache."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Re-index Method to use for all Data Queries."
msgstr "Mbinu chaguo-msingi ya Kuweka Faharasa Upya ya kutumia kwa Hoja zote za Data."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Site for all new Devices."
msgstr "Eneo chaguo-msingi kwa Vifaa vyote vipya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Timeshift displayed when viewing Graphs and other time specific data."
msgstr "Mbadilisho chaguo-msingi wa Muda unaoonyeshwa unapotazama Grafu na data nyingine mahususi ya muda."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Timespan displayed when viewing Graphs and other time specific data."
msgstr "Kipindi chaguo-msingi cha Muda kinachoonyeshwa unapotazama Grafu na data nyingine mahususi ya muda."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default graph tree to use when displaying graphs in tree mode."
msgstr "Mti chaguo-msingi wa grafu wa kutumia unapoonyesha grafu katika hali ya mti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Kadupul's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Idadi chaguo-msingi ya juu zaidi ya OID za SNMP Get za kutoa kwa kila ombi la snmpget.  Kwa Vifaa, mpangilio huu unadhibitiwa katika kiwango cha Kifaa.  Unapaswa kutumia mpangilio huu tu unapotumia API ya SNMP ya Kadupul asili katika hati au programu-jalizi zako."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of Device Threads.  This is only applicable when using the Spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Idadi chaguo-msingi ya Nyuzi za Kifaa.  Hii inatumika tu unapotumia Kikusanyaji Data cha Spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  NOTE: Starting from Kadupul 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the number of CPU cores."
msgstr "Idadi chaguo-msingi ya michakato ya pamoja ya kutekeleza kwa kila Kikusanyaji Data.  KUMBUKA: Kuanzia Kadupul 1.2, mpangilio huu unasimamiwa katika Kikusanyaji Data.  Kwenda mbele, thamani hii ni mpangilio wa awali tu kwa Kikusanyaji Data.  Kutumia namba ya juu zaidi unapotumia cmd.php kutaboresha utendaji.  Uboreshaji wa utendaji katika Spine unatatuliwa vyema zaidi kwa kigezo cha threads.  Unapotumia Spine, tunapendekeza namba ya chini na kutumia threads badala yake.  Unapotumia cmd.php, usitumie zaidi ya mara 2 ya idadi ya viini vya CPU."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of rows to display for a table."
msgstr "Idadi chaguo-msingi ya safu za kuonyesha kwa jedwali."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of rows to return from an autocomplete based select pattern match."
msgstr "Idadi chaguo-msingi ya safu za kurudisha kutoka kwa ulinganisho wa muundo wa uteuzi unaotegemea ukamilishaji otomatiki."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Muda chaguo-msingi wa usawazishaji wa kukusanya data wa kutumia unapounda poller.  Mpangilio huu utaathiri jinsi pollers za mbali zinavyokaguliwa na kusasishwa mara kwa mara."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The encryption method to use for the Email."
msgstr "Mbinu ya usimbaji fiche ya kutumia kwa Barua pepe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the backup proxy is using. This is required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Alama ya kidole ya ufunguo wa sasa wa umma wa RSA ambao proksi ya nakala rudufu inatumia. Hii inahitajika ili kuanzisha muunganisho unaoaminika."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the proxy is using. This is required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Alama ya kidole ya ufunguo wa sasa wa umma wa RSA ambao proksi inatumia. Hii inahitajika ili kuanzisha muunganisho unaoaminika."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The first Day of the Week for weekly Graph Displays"
msgstr "Siku ya kwanza ya Wiki kwa Maonyesho ya Grafu ya kila wiki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The font to use for Graph Axis items.  Enter a Pango font description, such as DejaVu Sans Bold. RRDtool does not load font files."
msgstr "Fonti ya kutumia kwa vipengee vya Mhimili wa Grafu.  Ingiza maelezo ya fonti ya Pango, kama vile DejaVu Sans Bold. RRDtool haipakii faili za fonti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The font to use for Graph Legends.  Enter a Pango font description, such as DejaVu Sans Bold. RRDtool does not load font files."
msgstr "Fonti ya kutumia kwa Maelezo ya Grafu.  Ingiza maelezo ya fonti ya Pango, kama vile DejaVu Sans Bold. RRDtool haipakii faili za fonti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The font to use for Graph Titles.  Enter a Pango font description, such as DejaVu Sans Bold. RRDtool does not load font files."
msgstr "Fonti ya kutumia kwa Vichwa vya Grafu.  Ingiza maelezo ya fonti ya Pango, kama vile DejaVu Sans Bold. RRDtool haipakii faili za fonti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The font to use for Graph Unit items.  Enter a Pango font description, such as DejaVu Sans Bold. RRDtool does not load font files."
msgstr "Fonti ya kutumia kwa vipengee vya Vipimo vya Grafu.  Ingiza maelezo ya fonti ya Pango, kama vile DejaVu Sans Bold. RRDtool haipakii faili za fonti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Kadupul data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Kadupul data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Masafa ambayo kikusanyaji data cha Kadupul kitaanzishwa.  Unaweza kutumia aidha crontab, kazi iliyopangwa (kwa windows), au huduma ya cactid systemd ili kudhibiti kuanzisha kikusanyaji data cha Kadupul.  Kwa maelekezo ya kutumia daemon ya cactid, kagua faili ya README.md katika saraka ya huduma."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The height of Thumbnail graphs in pixels."
msgstr "Kimo cha grafu za Picha Ndogo kwa pikseli."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum Data Query field length."
msgstr "Urefu wa juu zaidi wa sehemu ya Hoja ya Data."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum allowable Graph or Data Source titles."
msgstr "Vichwa vya juu zaidi vinavyoruhusiwa vya Grafu au Chanzo cha Data."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Kadupul Poller and Boosts Poller"
msgstr "Kiwango cha juu cha kumbukumbu kwa Poller ya Kadupul na Poller ya Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Kadupul Poller and Data Source Statistics Poller"
msgstr "Kiwango cha juu cha kumbukumbu kwa Poller ya Kadupul na Poller ya Takwimu za Chanzo cha Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Background Commands script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed.  This script will perform tasks such as re-indexing Devices and pruning devices from Remote Data Collectors."
msgstr "Kiwango cha juu cha muda ambao hati ya Amri za Chinichini ya Kadupul inaweza kuendeshwa bila kutoa hitilafu ya kuisha muda na kuuawa.  Hati hii itafanya kazi kama vile kuweka faharasa upya Vifaa na kuondoa vifaa kutoka kwa Vikusanyaji Data vya Mbali."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Data Source Statistics script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Kiwango cha juu cha muda ambao hati ya Takwimu za Chanzo cha Data ya Kadupul inaweza kuendeshwa bila kutoa hitilafu ya kuisha muda na kuuawa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Maintenance script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Kiwango cha juu cha muda ambao hati ya Matengenezo ya Kadupul inaweza kuendeshwa bila kutoa hitilafu ya kuisha muda na kuuawa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's RRDfile check script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Kiwango cha juu cha muda ambao hati ya ukaguzi wa RRDfile ya Kadupul inaweza kuendeshwa bila kutoa hitilafu ya kuisha muda na kuuawa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Reports Generation script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Kiwango cha juu cha muda ambao hati ya Uundaji wa Ripoti ya Kadupul inaweza kuendeshwa bila kutoa hitilafu ya kuisha muda na kuuawa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Spikekill script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Kiwango cha juu cha muda ambao hati ya Spikekill ya Kadupul inaweza kuendeshwa bila kutoa hitilafu ya kuisha muda na kuuawa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum number of Device Directories to be created based upon hashed Device IDs."
msgstr "Idadi ya juu zaidi ya Saraka za Vifaa zitakazoundwa kulingana na ID za Vifaa zilizofichwa (hashed)."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum size of the Email message including all attachments."
msgstr "Ukubwa wa juu zaidi wa ujumbe wa Barua pepe ikijumuisha viambatisho vyote."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Muda wa juu zaidi ambao spine itasubiri hati ikamilike.  Thamani hii ya muda wa kusubiri iko katika sekunde na ni halali kwa Kikusanyaji Data cha spine pekee."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The method used to Clean RRDfiles from Kadupul after their Data Sources are deleted."
msgstr "Mbinu inayotumika Kusafisha RRDfiles kutoka Kadupul baada ya Vyanzo vyao vya Data kufutwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The most refused samples one data source may keep queued.  The oldest samples beyond this limit are moved to the poller_output_rejected table immediately."
msgstr "Idadi kubwa zaidi ya sampuli zilizokataliwa ambazo chanzo kimoja cha data kinaweza kuweka kwenye foleni.  Sampuli za zamani zaidi zinazozidi kikomo hiki huhamishiwa kwenye jedwali la poller_output_rejected mara moja."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the guest user for viewing graphs; is 'No User' by default."
msgstr "Jina la mtumiaji mgeni kwa ajili ya kutazama grafu; ni 'Hakuna Mtumiaji' kwa chaguo-msingi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the primary administrative account that will automatically receive Emails when the Kadupul system experiences issues.  To receive these Emails, ensure that your mail settings are correct, and the administrative account has an Email address that is set."
msgstr "Jina la akaunti kuu ya usimamizi ambayo itapokea Barua pepe kiotomatiki wakati mfumo wa Kadupul unapokumbana na matatizo.  Ili kupokea Barua pepe hizi, hakikisha mipangilio yako ya barua ni sahihi, na akaunti ya usimamizi ina anwani ya Barua pepe iliyowekwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the user that Kadupul will use as a template for new Web Basic and LDAP users; is 'guest' by default.  This user account will be disabled from logging in upon being selected."
msgstr "Jina la mtumiaji ambaye Kadupul itatumia kama kiolezo kwa watumiaji wapya wa Web Basic na LDAP; ni 'guest' kwa chaguo-msingi.  Akaunti hii ya mtumiaji itazimwa kuingia baada ya kuchaguliwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of alert rules read and evaluated together. The time budget is checked between batches."
msgstr "Idadi ya kanuni za tahadhari zinazosomwa na kutathminiwa kwa pamoja. Bajeti ya muda hukaguliwa kati ya makundi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of columns to use when displaying Thumbnail graphs in Preview mode."
msgstr "Idadi ya safuwima za kutumia unapoonyesha grafu za Picha Ndogo katika hali ya Hakiki."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of columns to use when displaying Thumbnail graphs in Tree mode."
msgstr "Idadi ya safuwima za kutumia unapoonyesha grafu za Picha Ndogo katika hali ya Mti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent DSStats processes to use to process all of the Data Sources."
msgstr "Idadi ya michakato ya pamoja ya DSStats ya kutumia kuchakata Vyanzo vyote vya Data."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent Poller Command processes.  There will be at most one concurrent command per host within the Poller Command pool."
msgstr "Idadi ya michakato ya pamoja ya Amri ya Poller.  Kutakuwa na angalau amri moja ya pamoja kwa kila mwenyeji ndani ya kundi la Amri za Poller."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent RRDfile check processes to use to process all of rrd files."
msgstr "Idadi ya michakato ya pamoja ya ukaguzi wa RRDfile ya kutumia kuchakata faili zote za rrd."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "Idadi ya michakato ya pamoja ya boost ya kutumia kuchakata RRD zote katika jedwali la boost."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Idadi ya michakato ya pamoja ya seva ya hati ya kuendesha kwa kila mchakato wa spine.  Mipangilio kati ya 1 na 15 inakubaliwa.  Kigezo hiki kitasaidia ikiwa unaendesha nyuzi kadhaa na hati za seva ya hati na ni halali kwa Kikusanyaji Data cha spine pekee."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of consecutive hours that represent the hourly average.  Keep in mind that a setting too high can result in very large memory tables"
msgstr "Idadi ya saa mfululizo zinazowakilisha wastani wa kila saa.  Kumbuka kuwa mpangilio ulio juu mno unaweza kusababisha majedwali makubwa sana ya kumbukumbu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of graphs to display on one page in preview mode."
msgstr "Idadi ya grafu za kuonyesha kwenye ukurasa mmoja katika hali ya hakiki."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of polling intervals a Device must be down before logging an error and reporting Device as down."
msgstr "Idadi ya vipindi vya kukusanya data ambavyo Kifaa lazima kiwe chini kabla ya kuandika hitilafu na kuripoti Kifaa kuwa kiko chini."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of polling intervals a Device must remain up before returning Device to an up status and issuing a notice."
msgstr "Idadi ya vipindi vya kukusanya data ambavyo Kifaa lazima kibaki hewani kabla ya kurudisha Kifaa kwenye hali ya hewani na kutoa taarifa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of seconds between automatic page refreshes."
msgstr "Idadi ya sekunde kati ya uonyeshaji upya wa ukurasa kiotomatiki."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of times Kadupul will attempt to ping a Device before marking it as down."
msgstr "Idadi ya mara ambazo Kadupul itajaribu kupiga ping Kifaa kabla ya kukiweka alama kuwa kiko chini."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The password to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you do not require authentication.)"
msgstr "Nenosiri la kuthibitisha nalo unapotuma kupitia SMTP. (Acha wazi ikiwa huhitaji uthibitishaji.)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to Spine binary."
msgstr "Njia ya binari ya Spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to Spine configuration file.  By default, in the cwd of Spine, or /etc if not specified."
msgstr "Njia ya faili ya usanidi ya Spine.  Kwa chaguo-msingi, katika cwd ya Spine, au /etc ikiwa haijabainishwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to the rrdtool binary."
msgstr "Njia ya binari ya rrdtool."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to your Kadupul log file (if blank, defaults to &lt;path_cacti&gt;/log/cacti.log)"
msgstr "Njia ya faili yako ya kumbukumbu ya Kadupul (ikiwa wazi, chaguo-msingi ni &lt;path_cacti&gt;/log/cacti.log)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to your PHP binary file (may require a php recompile to get this file)."
msgstr "Njia ya faili yako ya binari ya PHP (huenda ikahitaji kuunda upya php ili kupata faili hii)."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to your snmpbulkwalk binary."
msgstr "Njia ya binari yako ya snmpbulkwalk."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to your snmpget binary."
msgstr "Njia ya binari yako ya snmpget."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to your snmpgetnext binary."
msgstr "Njia ya binari yako ya snmpgetnext."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to your snmptrap binary."
msgstr "Njia ya binari yako ya snmptrap."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to your snmpwalk binary."
msgstr "Njia ya binari yako ya snmpwalk."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The poller type to use.  This setting will take effect at next polling interval."
msgstr "Aina ya poller ya kutumia.  Mpangilio huu utaanza kutumika katika muda ujao wa kukusanya data."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
msgstr "Muda wa kukusanya data unaotumika.  Mpangilio huu utaathiri jinsi RRDfiles zinavyokaguliwa na kusasishwa mara kwa mara.  <strong><u>KUMBUKA: Ukibadilisha thamani hii, ni lazima ujaze upya kache ya poller.  Kushindwa kufanya hivyo, kunaweza kusababisha kupotea kwa data.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The port on the SMTP Server to use."
