#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the hostname/IP of the SMTP Server you will send the Email to. For failover, separate your hosts using a semi-colon."
msgstr "Hili ni jina la mwenyeji/IP ya Seva ya SMTP utakayotuma Barua pepe kwake. Kwa nakala rudufu (failover), tenganisha wenyeji wako kwa kutumia nukta-mkato (;)."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the location, on the web server where the RRDfiles and PNG files will be cached.  This cache will be managed by the poller.  Make sure you have the correct read and write permissions on this folder"
msgstr "Hili ni eneo, kwenye seva ya wavuti ambapo RRDfiles na faili za PNG zitawekwa kache.  Kache hii itasimamiwa na poller.  Hakikisha una ruhusa sahihi za kusoma na kuandika kwenye folda hii"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the maximum number of days before a password is set to expire."
msgstr "Hii ni idadi ya juu zaidi ya siku kabla nenosiri halijapangiwa kuisha muda wake."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the maximum number of days before inactive accounts are disabled.  The Admin account is excluded from this policy."
msgstr "Hii ni idadi ya juu zaidi ya siku kabla akaunti zisizotumika hazijazimwa.  Akaunti ya Admin imetengwa na sera hii."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the minimal length of allowed passwords."
msgstr "Huu ni urefu wa chini kabisa wa manenosiri yanayoruhusiwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the minimal supported time between Graph updates.  This value is also used to set certain RRDfile attributes.  If you have a Device that caches data and does not provide realtime updates, you may have to increase the default Minimum Refresh Interval to prevent creating Graphs with gaps."
msgstr "Huu ni muda mfupi zaidi unaoauniwa kati ya masasisho ya Grafu.  Thamani hii pia hutumika kuweka sifa fulani za RRDfile.  Ikiwa una Kifaa kinachoweka kache ya data na hakitoi masasisho ya wakati halisi, huenda ukahitaji kuongeza Muda chaguo-msingi wa Chini wa Kuonyesha Upya ili kuzuia kuunda Grafu zenye mapengo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the path to sendmail on your server. (Only used if Sendmail is selected as the Mail Service)"
msgstr "Hii ni njia ya sendmail kwenye seva yako. (Hutumika tu ikiwa Sendmail imechaguliwa kama Huduma ya Barua)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the server location that will be used for links to the Kadupul site. This should include the subdirectory if Kadupul does not run from root folder."
msgstr "Hili ni eneo la seva litakalotumika kwa viungo kwenda kwenye tovuti ya Kadupul. Hili linapaswa kujumuisha saraka ndogo ikiwa Kadupul haiendeshwi kutoka folda kuu (root)."

