#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "This refers to the specific attribute within the LDAP directory that holds the usernames of group members. It is crucial to ensure that the attribute value aligns with the configuration specified in the \"Distinguished Name\" or that the actual attribute value is searchable using the settings outlined in the \"Distinguished Name\"."
msgstr "Hii inarejelea sifa mahususi ndani ya saraka ya LDAP iliyo na majina ya watumiaji ya wanachama wa kikundi. Ni muhimu sana kuhakikisha kuwa thamani ya sifa inalingana na usanidi uliobainishwa katika \"Distinguished Name\" au kwamba thamani halisi ya sifa inaweza kutafutwa kwa kutumia mipangilio iliyoainishwa katika \"Distinguished Name\"."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Mpangilio huu ni kwa mifumo ya poller moja pekee ili kujenga upya jedwali la towe la poller katika kila mzunguko wa kukusanya data ili kuzuia jedwali la kumbukumbu kufanya swap kwenye mifumo mikubwa sana yenye hifadhidata kubwa zinazoweza kutumia swap."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the maximum number of spikes to remove from a Graph RRA."
msgstr "Thamani hii inawakilisha idadi ya juu zaidi ya miinuko ya ghafla (spikes) ya kuondoa kutoka kwa RRA ya Grafu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the number of high and low average samples that will be removed from the sample set prior to calculating the Variance Average.  If you choose an outlier value of 5, then both the top and bottom 5 averages are removed."
msgstr "Thamani hii inawakilisha idadi ya sampuli za wastani za juu na za chini zitakazoondolewa kutoka kwa seti ya sampuli kabla ya kukokotoa Wastani wa Mabadiliko (Variance).  Ukichagua thamani ya outlier ya 5, basi wastani 5 za juu na 5 za chini zinaondolewa."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "This value represents the percentage above the adjusted sample average once outliers have been removed from the sample.  For example, a Variance Percentage of 100%% on an adjusted average of 50 would remove any sample above the quantity of 100 from the graph."
msgstr "Thamani hii inawakilisha asilimia iliyo juu ya wastani wa sampuli uliorekebishwa mara tu thamani za nje (outliers) zinapoondolewa kwenye sampuli.  Kwa mfano, Asilimia ya Mabadiliko ya 100%% kwenye wastani uliorekebishwa wa 50 itaondoa sampuli yoyote iliyo juu ya kiasi cha 100 kutoka kwenye grafu."

