#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When creating graphs, what Graph Type would you like preselected?"
msgstr "Unapounda grafu, ni Aina gani ya Grafu ungependa ichaguliwe mapema?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Kadupul Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Ikizimwa, Otomatiki ya Kadupul haitaunda Grafu yoyote kikamilifu.  Hii ni muhimu unaporekebisha mipangilio ya Kifaa ili kuepuka kuunda Grafu mpya kila unapohifadhi kipengee.  Kuendesha Kanuni za Otomatiki kwa mkono bado kutawezekana."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Kadupul Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Ikizimwa, Otomatiki ya Kadupul haitaunda Kipengee chochote cha Mti kikamilifu.  Hii ni muhimu unaporekebisha mipangilio ya Kifaa au Grafu ili kuepuka kuunda Maingizo mapya ya Mti kila unapohifadhi kipengee.  Kuendesha Kanuni kwa mkono bado kutawezekana."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When displaying Graphs, allow Graph Dates to extend 'to future'"
msgstr "Unapoonyesha Grafu, ruhusu Tarehe za Grafu kupanuka 'hadi siku zijazo'"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Kadupul will not lock Graphs.  This allows a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Ikiwezeshwa, Kadupul haitafunga Grafu.  Hii huruhusu marekebisho ya haraka ya mkono ya Vyanzo vya Data vinavyohusiana na Grafu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Kadupul will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Kadupul will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Ikiwezeshwa, Kadupul itaweka Kitufe cha Redio kufuta Vyanzo vya Data vinavyohusiana vya Grafu unapoondoa Grafu.  Kumbuka: Kadupul haitaruhusu uondoaji wa Vyanzo vya Data ikiwa vinatumika katika Grafu nyingine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When not using Theme based font control, the Pango font description to use for all Graphs, such as DejaVu Sans. Optionally, you may leave blank and control font settings on a per object basis."
msgstr "Usipotumia udhibiti wa fonti unaotegemea Mandhari, maelezo ya fonti ya Pango ya kutumia kwa Grafu zote, kama vile DejaVu Sans. Kwa hiari, unaweza kuacha wazi na kudhibiti mipangilio ya fonti kwa kila kipengee."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When performing batch spike removal, only the templates selected below will be acted on."
msgstr "Unapofanya uondoaji wa miinuko ya ghafla kwa kundi, violezo vilivyochaguliwa hapa chini pekee ndivyo vitashughulikiwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using Syslog/Eventlog for logging, the Kadupul log messages that will be forwarded to the Syslog/Eventlog."
msgstr "Unapotumia Syslog/Eventlog kwa kumbukumbu, jumbe za kumbukumbu za Kadupul zitakazotumwa mbele kwa Syslog/Eventlog."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if the basic account needs to be translated to a different login account, you can specify a CSV file here to map the basic account to the desired login account."
msgstr "Unapotumia uthibitishaji wa msingi, ikiwa akaunti ya msingi inahitaji kutafsiriwa kwenda kwenye akaunti tofauti ya kuingia, unaweza kubainisha faili ya CSV hapa ili kuunganisha akaunti ya msingi na akaunti ya kuingia unayotaka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if there are issues mapping the username to a valid Kadupul account, the message included here will be displayed to users.  It can include both text and HTML."
msgstr "Unapotumia uthibitishaji wa msingi, ikiwa kuna matatizo ya kuunganisha jina la mtumiaji na akaunti halali ya Kadupul, ujumbe uliojumuishwa hapa utaonyeshwa kwa watumiaji.  Unaweza kujumuisha maandishi na HTML zote mbili."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When viewing Device name filter dropdowns, checking this option will strip the domain from the hostname."
msgstr "Unapotazama menyu kunjuzi za vichujio vya majina ya Vifaa, kuteua chaguo hili kutaondoa kikoa kutoka kwa jina la mwenyeji."

