#: utilities.php
msgid "The Data Query Cache stores information gathered from Data Query input types. The values from these fields can be used in the text area of Graphs for Legends, Vertical Labels, and GPRINTs as well as in CDEFs."
msgstr "Kache ya Hoja ya Data huhifadhi taarifa zilizokusanywa kutoka kwa aina za ingizo la Hoja ya Data. Thamani kutoka sehemu hizi zinaweza kutumika katika eneo la maandishi la Grafu kwa Maelezo ya Grafu, Lebo za Wima, na GPRINTS pamoja na katika CDEF."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Kadupul Log stores statistics, error and other messages depending on system settings.  This information can be used to identify problems with the poller and application."
msgstr "Kumbukumbu ya Kadupul huhifadhi takwimu, hitilafu na jumbe nyingine kulingana na mipangilio ya mfumo.  Taarifa hii inaweza kutumika kutambua matatizo na poller na programu."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Poller Cache will be re-generated if you select this option. Use this option only in the event of a database crash if you are experiencing issues after the crash and have already run the database repair tools.  Alternatively, if you are having problems with a specific Device, simply re-save that Device to rebuild its Poller Cache.  There is also a command line interface equivalent to this command that is recommended for large systems."
msgstr "Kache ya Poller itaundwa upya ukichagua chaguo hili. Tumia chaguo hili tu iwapo hifadhidata itaanguka ikiwa unakumbana na matatizo baada ya kuanguka na tayari umeendesha zana za kukarabati hifadhidata.  Vinginevyo, ikiwa una matatizo na Kifaa mahususi, hifadhi tena Kifaa hicho ili kujenga upya Kache yake ya Poller.  Pia kuna amri sawa ya mstari wa amri inayopendekezwa kwa mifumo mikubwa."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The SNMP cache will be cleared and re-generated if you select this option. Note that it takes another poller run to restore the SNMP cache completely."
msgstr "Kache ya SNMP itafutwa na kuundwa upya ukichagua chaguo hili. Kumbuka kuwa inachukua mzunguko mwingine wa poller kurejesha kache ya SNMP kikamilifu."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The minimum required can vary greatly if there is heavy user Graph viewing activity."
msgstr "Kiwango cha chini kinachohitajika kinaweza kutofautiana sana ikiwa kuna shughuli nyingi za watumiaji za kutazama Grafu."

#: utilities.php
msgid "This is the data that is being passed to the poller each time it runs. This data is then in turn executed/interpreted and the results are fed into the RRDfiles for graphing or the database for display."
msgstr "Hii ni data inayopitishwa kwa poller kila inapoendeshwa. Data hii kisha inatekelezwa/kutafsiriwa na matokeo yake yanaingizwa kwenye RRDfiles kwa ajili ya kuchora grafu au kwenye hifadhidata kwa ajili ya kuonyesha."

#: utilities.php
msgid "This menu pick allows you to view the latest events SNMP Agent has handled in relation to the registered notification receivers."
msgstr "Chaguo hili la menyu linakuruhusu kutazama matukio ya hivi karibuni ambayo Wakala wa SNMP ameshughulikia kuhusiana na wapokeaji wa arifa waliosajiliwa."

#: utilities.php
msgid "This menu pick allows you to view various boost settings and statistics associated with the current running Boost configuration."
msgstr "Chaguo hili la menyu linakuruhusu kutazama mipangilio na takwimu mbalimbali za boost zinazohusiana na usanidi wa sasa wa Boost unaoendeshwa."

#: utilities.php
msgid "This menu pick will purge all existing Data Source Statistics from the Database.  If Data Source Statistics is enabled, the Data Sources Statistics will start collection again on the next Data Collector pass."
msgstr "Chaguo hili la menyu litasafisha kabisa Takwimu zote zilizopo za Chanzo cha Data kutoka kwa Hifadhidata.  Ikiwa Takwimu za Chanzo cha Data zimewezeshwa, Takwimu za Vyanzo vya Data zitaanza kukusanya tena katika mzunguko ujao wa Kikusanyaji Data."

#: utilities.php
msgid "This shows all objects being handled by the SNMP Agent."
msgstr "Hii inaonyesha vipengee vyote vinavyoshughulikiwa na Wakala wa SNMP."

#: utilities.php
msgid "This suggested memory value is calculated based on the number of data sources present and is only to be used as a suggestion, actual values may vary system to system based on requirements."
msgstr "Thamani hii ya kumbukumbu iliyopendekezwa inakokotolewa kulingana na idadi ya vyanzo vya data vilivyopo na inapaswa kutumika kama pendekezo tu, thamani halisi zinaweza kutofautiana kutoka mfumo hadi mfumo kulingana na mahitaji."

