#: utilities.php
msgid "When operating multiple Data Collectors in Kadupul, Kadupul will attempt to maintain state for key files on all Data Collectors.  This includes all core, non-install related website and plugin files.  When you force a Resource Cache rebuild, Kadupul will clear the local Resource Cache, and then rebuild it at the next scheduled poller start.  This will trigger all Remote Data Collectors to recheck their website and plugin files for consistency."
msgstr "Unapoendesha Vikusanyaji Data vingi katika Kadupul, Kadupul itajaribu kudumisha hali ya faili muhimu kwenye Vikusanyaji Data vyote.  Hii inajumuisha faili zote za msingi, zisizo za usakinishaji za tovuti na programu-jalizi.  Unapolazimisha ujenzi upya wa Kache ya Rasilimali, Kadupul itafuta Kache ya Rasilimali ya ndani, na kisha kuijenga upya wakati ujao uliopangwa wa poller kuanza.  Hii itasababisha Vikusanyaji Data vyote vya Mbali kukagua upya faili zao za tovuti na programu-jalizi kwa uthabiti."

#: utilities.php
msgid "When you delete Data Sources from Kadupul, the corresponding RRDfiles are not removed automatically.  Use this utility to facilitate the removal of these old files."
msgstr "Unapofuta Vyanzo vya Data kutoka Kadupul, RRDfiles zinazolingana haziondolewi kiotomatiki.  Tumia zana hii kurahisisha uondoaji wa faili hizi za zamani."

